## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo: explicit invalidation on write
async function updateProduct(id, data) {
  await db.update('products', id, data);
  await redis.del(`product:list`);
  await redis.del(`product:${id}`);
  await publishEvent('product.updated', { id });
